<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: elder raptor -->
  <OE_Elder_Raptor.label>远古迅猛龙</OE_Elder_Raptor.label>
  <!-- EN: Raptors are large, aggressive theropods, but seem to be very intelligent for beasts. These theropods prefer to live in warmer climates. Difficult but accessible to taming, which makes these fast and deadly predators an excellent fighting unit.\n\nYet one Raptor was different. After a violent volcanic eruption scorched the southern plains, this lone survivor began to display unnatural agility and heightened aggression. Unbeknownst to observers, the creature had absorbed an EGO Seed buried beneath ancient lava beds—melding it with its own genetic code over years of solitude and constant pursuit.\n\nThe resulting Elder Raptor is a blur of motion and violence. Quicker than the eye, with claws that rend steel and a feral leap that closes any distance in a flash, it is evolution given purpose.\n\nElder Raptors are even rarer and more dangerous than the typical Raptor. -->
  <OE_Elder_Raptor.description>迅猛龙是大型、具有攻击性的兽脚类恐龙，但对于野兽来说似乎非常聪明。这些兽脚类恐龙更喜欢生活在温暖的气候中。难以但可以驯服，这使得这些快速而致命的掠食者成为优秀的战斗单位。\n\n但有一只迅猛龙与众不同。在一次剧烈的火山喷发烤焦了南部平原后，这只孤独的幸存者开始表现出非自然的敏捷性和增强的攻击性。观察者们不知道的是，这只生物吸收了埋在古老熔岩床下的EGO种子——在多年的孤独和持续追捕中，将其与自己的基因代码融合。\n\n由此产生的远古迅猛龙是运动和暴力的模糊身影。比眼睛更快，拥有撕裂钢铁的利爪和野性的一跃，能在瞬间跨越任何距离，它是被赋予了目的的进化。\n\n远古迅猛龙比普通的迅猛龙更加稀有和危险。</OE_Elder_Raptor.description>
